  <description lang="en-GB" default="true">Heavy-bodied sword with a thick blade that can split a helmet in two. (Drawn)\nAttacking Strength: ★★★+[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="ja-JP" default="false">刃肉が厚く、兜を真っ二つに割るほどの重厚な刀。（抜刀状態）\n攻撃力 ：★★★+[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="en-US" default="false">Heavy-bodied sword with a thick blade that can split a helmet in two. (Drawn)\nAttacking Strength: ★★★+[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="en-SG" default="false">Heavy-bodied sword with a thick blade that can split a helmet in two. (Drawn)\nAttacking Strength: ★★★+[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="fr-FR" default="false">Épée massive à lame épaisse capable de fendre un casque en deux. (Dégainée)\nPuissance d’attaque : ★★★+[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="es-ES" default="false">Espada de cuerpo pesado con una hoja gruesa capaz de partir un casco en dos. (Desenvainada)\nFuerza de ataque: ★★★+[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="it-IT" default="false">Spada dal corpo massiccio con una lama spessa che può spaccare un elmo a metà. (Sguainata)\nPotenza d'attacco: ★★★+[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="de-DE" default="false">Schwert mit schwerem Körper und dicker Klinge, die einen Helm spalten kann. (Gezogen)\nAngriffsstärke: ★★★+[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="zh-HK" default="false">厚重的刀身與厚刃，可將頭盔一分為二。（拔刀）\n攻擊力：★★★+[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="zh-TW" default="false">厚重的刀身與厚刃，可將頭盔一分為二。（拔刀）\n攻擊力：★★★+[#Legal]</description>
  <description lang="ko-KR" default="false">두꺼운 칼날을 가진 무거운 검으로 헬멧을 둘로 가를 수 있습니다. (발도)\n공격력: ★★★+[#Legal]</description>
